	(text "MAIN_IN (12-50 V) = Data_In pin 4 or Main_In terminal, diode-OR-ed (reverse-polarity protection).\nTVS is DNP: fit SMBJ28A only on 12-24 V builds (no TVS can protect 60 V parts above ~33 V).\nF1 (PTC rated >= 60 V; choose the part and check its fault-current rating) protects the Data_Out pin 4 pass-through."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 250 0)
