		(uuid "1461371d-e6ed-4a48-bdbe-a1cb691ea403")
	)
	(text "Optional ESP module (WLED, ESPHome...): Wemos D1 mini generic pinout on two 1x8 sockets, stacked above the board\n(low parts may sit underneath). SPI master -> RP2040 SPI0 slave: D5 SCK -> CLK, D7 MOSI -> DIN, D6 MISO <- DOUT, D8 CS -> ESP_CS.\nAssumes no external data in when the ESP is fitted. 3-pin header 5V/DATA/GND: DATA joins DIN for single-wire (WS2812) data.\nPowered from the main-power 5V only (not USB); flash it through its own USB. 3V3 not connected."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 278 150 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "5076aa18-679c-444e-842a-b3a9d061cd2c")
	)
