	(text "Driver 3 buck (LM5164, DNP by default): VSn = 1.2V x (1 + 499k/15.2k + 499k/60.4k) - Vdac x 499k/60.4k = 24..50.5 V for Vdac 3.2..0 V.\nFit EITHER this buck block OR the 0R link to HVBUS, never both. fSW = 400-800 kHz."
